<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1208_3991.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig dienst, sambt was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetz</unclear> vermoegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">from</unclear>, fürsichtig, ersam,
