<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßen</unclear>. Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> burger <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schelch</unclear></persName>, hatt unnß unnderthenig gehorsamblich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angebraacht</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerkennen</unclear> geben. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Welchermaßen</unclear> ime,
<lb n="7"/>unnd sinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwüsterigten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nattürlicher</unclear> erbs gerechtig-
